        { "host": "A", "text": "He called it a Cold War moment and accused AI companies of trying to form a cartel. CNN reports he wants the President to create a regulatory agency by executive action rather than legislation, and shared no specifics on what it would look like." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Where they split is China. Sanders wants a treaty. Bannon called for barring Chinese nationals from US universities and labs. CNN labels the piece analysis, it's a single source, and the event produced no legislative commitment." }
