      "type": "item",
      "section": "Compute, chips & infrastructure",
      "headline": "AWS says it cannot restore its Bahrain region or one UAE availability zone after Iranian strikes",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "Data Center Dynamics reports AWS gave customers a status update on its Middle East regions in the UAE and Bahrain this week." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "And the update is that the data is gone." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "For some of it, yes. On the UAE, AWS said after a thorough assessment it is unable to restore access to the resources and data hosted exclusively in one availability zone. Recovery continues for the other two." },
