        { "host": "A", "text": "A Cornell maths professor, Lionel Levine, warned against anything in the direction of an automated surveillance state where people feel they have to be careful what they say to AI. This is a single source. Neither hotline has published a report count, and there's no evidence yet that any agent has used one in a real deployment." }
