    { "host": "A", "text": "Positive predictive value of 14.4%. So most positives are false. Negative predictive value is 99.0%, which is where the value sits. It's a preprint, not peer reviewed, and a single source. One site, and a population already referred for echocardiography rather than a screening population." }
  ]
