      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "CrowdStrike published a report on a JavaScript information stealer it calls PhantomRaven, distributed through npm packages." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "And the AI angle?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "CrowdStrike says the code was almost certainly LLM-generated, and the author's technical sophistication is likely low. Its evidence is statistical token-analysis patterns, verbose comments and placeholder code, including a comment before every global variable and function definition." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Who's behind it?" },
