          ],
          "impact": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "headline": "Zuckerberg says alignment is a capability, not a reason to slow down, citing Meta's delay of Muse",
          "sources": [
            {
              "name": "CNBC",
              "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/15/meta-mark-zuckerberg-with-nvidia-huang-ai-safety-slowdown.html"
